l":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/9738","id":1061565234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAEfiCM4_RjMy","user":{"login":"chickenlj","id":18097545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj","html_url":"https://github.com/chickenlj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-08T09:16:17Z","updated_at":"2022-03-08T09:16:17Z","body":"抱歉带来curator5兼容性问题。\r\n\r\n之前我们专注在 curator5+jdk17 的支持上，为此，中间有段时间我们的curator默认版本升级到了5.x版本，但考虑到默认curator5用户升级的难度与兼容性问题（尤其是与低版本zookeeper server的互操作性），因此后续我们又进行了curator版本回退，在回退过程中jdk8版本编译后的兼容性没覆盖到。\r\n\r\n\r\n```xml\r\n        <profile>\r\n            <id>curator5</id>\r\n            <activation>\r\n                <jdk>[17,)</jdk>\r\n            </activation>\r\n            <properties>\r\n                <zookeeper_version>3.7.0</zookeeper_version>\r\n                <curator_version>5.1.0</curator_version>\r\n            </properties>\r\n        </profile>\r\n```\r\n\r\n我想我们当前可以通过尽快发布新版本来覆盖 curator5 版本的兼容性问题","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/comments/1061565234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"perf